      "writtenOn": "2024-11-27T16:36:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello !! Nice to see you here ! \n\nI had a similar request from another OEM (https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/frameworks/av/+/3290543) \n\nI think the correct implementation is this one: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/frameworks/av/+/3380568\n\nBut I talked with the camera team who basically told me that producerUsage are meant to be written and consumed by vendor component. \n\nVirtualCamera is a special case here since we don\u0027t know the Allocator implementation so we can\u0027t make assumption on the usage needed. \n\nLet\u0027s try with the new CL and see how it goes.",
